  "answer": "KGP 原文明确提出以段落为节点、以词法/语义相似性为边构图的表示方式：作者称“we construct a KG over the given documents with nodes symbolizing passages or document structures and edges denoting their lexical/semantic similarity between passages or intra-document structural relations”[chunk_4c2f9284ed69432f1dd6ad5217a9a783]，并进一步说明“we construct the graph by modeling passages as nodes and their lexical/semantic similarity as edges”[chunk_a006300cceffa4ef993988ac0e2e4f8c]。其检索机制是 LLM 驱动的 KG 遍历智能体，交替进行证据生成与邻居选择：“we design an LLM-based KG traversal agent, which can alternatively generate the next evidence ... and select the most promising neighbor to visit from the constructed KG”[chunk_4c2f9284ed69432f1dd6ad5217a9a783]。关于 HippoRAG 的图表示与检索流程，所给证据仅描述其查询-KG实体不确定时的集成与分数平均机制[chunk_67a081d945c23e9c2de3a746cbacb122]，并提及 PPR 阻尼因子与同义阈值等超参数[chunk_fe5363c7abef240f62c37ad4ab224530]，未提供其段落节点加语义相似边的图定义；因此在所给证据范围内容，缺少将 KGP 图定义直接作为 HippoRAG 图定义的依据，HippoRAG 的图构建与检索流程证据不足。",
